{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "13def333298aa0c5182f8c974d45d6441842823c5e44e620f970552dcd558ba5", "ja": "（BOTも、次がいよいよ最終戦！\nそろそろ準備を始めないとだ。しかし……）", "zh": "（BOT接下来终于要进行最终战了！也该开始准备了。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0b96861051549e2b2bd0e59f394fedad4dafcc2be886800c0bb27d712a960695", "ja": "ラストバトルに相応しい内容か……\nどんな勝負にするか、悩むな……。", "zh": "这内容配得上最终战吗……\n要比什么才好，真让人苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "8f5e3233ba8283f8fe0d1c4162a511ce55c326a5adca95cd001d3d989fdc1f66", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nあの、何かお手伝いできることはありませんか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那个，有什么我能帮忙的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "716af241c46fec0a4d9a09081cc6abcac7d98c7eccf3d700e9bd56fe655552ed", "ja": "何でも言ってください！　袖がほつれたとか、\nお腹が空いたとか……あ、肩とか凝ってませんか？", "zh": "有什么事尽管告诉我！比如袖口脱线了，或者肚子饿了……啊，肩膀什么的没有酸痛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a24ec21665672baec73880a5a6894e84eb4cdda50e2784138d57f2609ddcd959", "ja": "えっ、大丈夫ですけど……どうしたんですか？\n青羽さん。なんだか、ソワソワしてますね。", "zh": "诶，没事啊……怎么了？\n青羽小姐。总觉得你有点坐立不安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "f5e0d465bc873dabc7f8411f44f79139e0ad56fdf178ef53ec5f53b8f05d6fd5", "ja": "だって、もうBOTがクライマックスなんですよね？\n私も、もっともっと力になりたいなぁって。", "zh": "因为，BOT已经进入高潮阶段了，对吧？我也想再多帮上更多忙啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e14e6209ab207b881174c0e239786cb424308c98e51d899dfff734073dfcddc2", "ja": "アイドルのみんなのためにも、\n{$P$}さんのためにも……！", "zh": "为了偶像们，\n也为了{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "a6c291cdd854da7d7e751b3f57afb3988040e8fe59741d326e59817b1f7f4091", "ja": "そうだ！　スーツを新調しませんか？　試したい\nデザインがあって、総刺繍で背面にモチーフを……！", "zh": "对了！要不要定制一套新西装？我有个想试试的设计，想在背面绣上完整的图案……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d9c4151a91bfdbe9e1f71154c998e4db6a69c7756abe9ea8e229ee9c9c327ac5", "ja": "いえ、スーツは大丈夫です！\nというか、そんなに気負わなくても……", "zh": "不，西装就不用了！\n话说回来，也不用这么紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2cb8168872d9fd11c586a79075c0a85e5897ee3b4ec502703f0626e88f73bcbe", "ja": "青羽さんは今のままでも、劇場になくては\nならない人ですから。自然体でいてください！", "zh": "青羽小姐现在这样，也已经是剧场不可或缺的人了。所以，请保持自然就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "0ff28d237ca2d9776e091abeaf16a057351d68f5ef79e666b53e557354b8ab45", "ja": "ええっ！　そ、そんな風に言ってもらえるなんて、\n感激しちゃうなぁ……えへへ♪", "zh": "诶诶！居、居然能得到这样的评价，真是太感动了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d8a23c46e573fb876b85f7f95ed2b61a603193a6c665d3c0de2b607444a3d276", "ja": "あ、そうそう。今日はこれから、事務所に\n行かないとなんです。留守番、お願いできますか？", "zh": "啊，对了。今天接下来还得去一趟事务所。可以麻烦你留在这里看家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "a2f546249b731b941d79e228c575f90b001ca5fcb4776b45d60a2ba3bcb8a9d6", "ja": "はいっ、わかりました！\n青羽美咲、しっかりと劇場を守りますね。", "zh": "好的，明白了！\n我青羽美咲会好好守护剧场的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "f3642d29e9eeb223ae3a7db1d16c7a30c97739fded6d8041a0d09134ec72d137", "ja": "それじゃ、行ってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "那么，您慢走啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "16d32ea5e1b94ac46663166affa340f1f112042f1c63bdf3cfb0dfeadbb8b9b2", "ja": "おお、君！　来てもらってすまない。\n実は、折り入って相談したいことがあってね。", "zh": "哦，是你啊！不好意思还特意叫你过来。\n其实，我有件事想郑重地和你商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e4e3d1a3d9bd4643c8b19a159b5c9b25d83d8f658243ce432a5cc9bf2f4f5e7c", "ja": "お疲れ様です！　ひょっとして、\nBOTに関するお話ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了！难道是要谈谈BOT的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "5153a950febb8ff35d9d557fb23081d98189911b91bada7d9345bb281cff4b8e", "ja": "おっと、その話もしないといけなかったね。", "zh": "哎呀，那个话题也得说一下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "e8b91f099a797ee76fcdac06dc69d33bf88d0ab45e571187b72998ca5e3885b2", "ja": "そうですよ、社長。BOT最終戦に相応しい\nステージとは……！　みんな期待してますよ！", "zh": "没错，社长。适合作为BOT最终战的舞台……！大家都很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "644c388da09f47e607edca45afb565bc7c4e63b4b26008dc0df9d355fb4e7093", "ja": "うむ！\nだが生憎、今日は別件なんだ。", "zh": "嗯！\n但不凑巧，今天我有别的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "80a111a08d026e07d21464a74c801f69d5883753a0c9a316a3e65313b616531f", "ja": "我が765プロに、コラボの打診があった。\nそれも、世界的なハイブランド2社から同時にだ！", "zh": "我们的765事务所收到了合作邀约。\n而且，还是世界级高端品牌2公司同时发来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "05e800bc5ef2fe2ea5faa5cd59a760854c1fd18f1d3a6a0bac7ae7f612ed3e7e", "ja": "えっ！？　2社から？", "zh": "咦！？是2家公司发来的邀请？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "d5a81b2e3ee74d51d9472ac1a9518c6b2ceba1c438cdbdf673e22df3fa7a3406", "ja": "スゴいですよね～。あの『ミラス・ミラン』と\n『スカジ』から、同時にオファーが来るなんて！", "zh": "真厉害啊～。居然同时收到来自『米拉斯·米兰』和『斯卡吉』的邀约！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "a9961da3118924e3aca243580cc91f147ecc78c434781082b2d9f1a1d38f9783", "ja": "私も学生の頃は、クラスメイトたちと「すごいね～、\n憧れるね～！」なんて話してましたっけ……。", "zh": "我上学的时候，也常和同学们聊“好厉害啊～，真让人憧憬啊～！”来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "bd18f0e6fda6226cd805adad95700fb8a0e260aa7fa6424360500059d5f7ae8a", "ja": "社会人になった今でも、全然手が出ませんけど！", "zh": "就算现在参加工作了，也完全买不起啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "634f5cf687be953d535abc7b2b6ae6f657ce81e6491c25dc2f6aba9c962a88c6", "ja": "はは……本当に、すごい話ですね。これも社長が、\n765プロをここまで大きくしてくれたお陰ですよ。", "zh": "哈哈……真是不得了的故事啊。这也多亏了社长，才让765事务所发展到今天这个规模。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "fddb0adb4953e3e7f8ffe3fb4025f1e59ccd51cd1625c9f5f5d8c2386e4fe1ca", "ja": "何を言うんだね！　君の力なくしては、\nこの躍進はなかった。もっと自信を持ってくれたまえ。", "zh": "你这说的是什么话！要是没有你的力量，就不会有这次飞跃。请再自信一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c4436c39bcdf6222bbca2845d822e3f2fde1128182f02f6e4c4c9f2571bd23e5", "ja": "社長……！", "zh": "社长……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "9e745346a76b0fecfdc643c66fe5f8186c3036adafbd2ea6d5d2988f61265cd3", "ja": "君……！", "zh": "你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "d775f3ec1649f6d3c22e98cec69faa04a4c38ee6c8285f936a283e98b2efbaf2", "ja": "あらっ、これは……。\nうふ、うふふふふ……♪", "zh": "哎呀，这是……\n呵呵，呵呵呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "aa8c75f9559fe2fb7e7ef9021ce8d44e48f55a17d95e6693206322ceeacf55ae", "ja": "うおっほん！　とにかく、これはチャンスだ。\n2社同時というのが、少々悩ましいところだがね。", "zh": "咳咳！总之，这是个好机会。\n虽然2家公司同时进行，这一点稍微有点让人伤脑筋就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "6fafaaf201f7f81f5461baa8802ac601d237b200fbed964cb52a4aa7e90915f8", "ja": "BOTもある今、かなり忙しいだろうが……。", "zh": "现在还有BOT在，想必相当忙碌吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_1032", "source_sha256": "36c22d7e197012a55e8ff5bb4af1beef70b99abc089af9169ee00a17a4b0026a", "ja": "やります！", "zh": "我要做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "405a1b7fe7dfd39e31caffff3cfe0f975ece465654e56eabb668a8eca4aa2caa", "ja": "大丈夫です！　プロデュース、任せてください！", "zh": "没问题！制作工作就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "db3b1201cc710a5bf65dcc4ba4f37371276356cdeab41c5e3c337313d460bded", "ja": "おおっ、食い気味にきてくれたね！\nやはり君は頼もしい。では、よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "哦哦，来得真够积极啊！\n果然还是你最可靠。那就拜托啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0440_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "fc1da63cc2ea55a188a8c7e88c1885d5dd9c7d4c9eb486a8ff7fe1c28f3cc1b6", "ja": "（このタイミングでのオファー、活かさない訳には\nいかないな。早速、企画を考えないと！）", "zh": "（在这个时机得到的邀约，可不能不好好利用。得赶紧想想企划了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
